---
description: Decide field-level findings for trackAcknowledgment.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Record receipt, acknowledgment, and reported completion distinctly, respecting contact preferences and quiet periods. Escalate unresolved administrative barriers under supplied procedures without assuming acknowledgment proves comprehension or medical readiness. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
